  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-7-PPR-4000006010</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-7" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting activities for the 2023 UN Water Conference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to facilitate the success of the 2023 UN Water Conference, RVO will provide: 1) additional organizational capacity to the Conference&#x2019;s core team at MFA; 2) Financial support to UN-DESA for organizing the conference in New York (contracting and payment of conferencing facilities); 3) financial support to stakeholders in the run-up to the Conference; 4) activities to support the Conference&#x2019;s public awareness/communications strategy; 5) an arrangement with OECD that will serve as the coordinating hub for the Global Commission on the Economics of Water, grants to 5 research centres identified while the Commission was formed and several additional research centres yet to be ideintified as well as contracts based on 2 or more tenders to organisations that will provide commercially sourced services - such as communication and travel, etc. - to the Commission  OECD will monitor implementation of the Commission&#x2019;s work: the Global Review of the Economics of Water.</narrative>
  </description>
